026-08-30", "plays": 109977, "likes": 2486, "comments": 15}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "If your wood kitchen cabinets are looking greasy, grimy, or maybe they just look a little dull, let me show you the best way to clean that up. The first thing to do is give your cabinets a really good dust. Now I like to recommend starting at the top and dusting your way down to the floor. So now that the cabinets are nice and dusted, it's time to mix up our cleaner. I like to recommend using Murphy Oil. What I like to do is always add about a gallon or so of warm water to a bucket and then about a capful only. So whenever you're mixing up Murphy's Oil, just kind of keep in the back of your head, less is more. For the cleaning process, I like to use my three towel system. Take our first towel and dip that into the cleaning solution bucket and make sure to wring it out really well. And I like to usually clean my cabinets kind of one at a time, that way I'm being as efficient as possible and not forgetting anything. Then we're going to go through and grab our second towel. This towel is just going to be dipped in a bucket with some warm water and this towel is there to rinse the surface. The goal here is to remove not only the dirt and grime that's on the cabinets, but also remove any cleaning residue that might be there. If we leave that behind, it's going to dry sticky and attract more dirt. The last towel is the secret sauce and that is just a clean, dry microfiber towel to dry and buff the surface. So by using that last towel to get them dry as quickly as possible, it's going to help prevent damage. If you were to just let them air dry, unfortunately you're going to get a ton of streaks and water marks. So by giving them a quick dry and buff, you completely prevent this. Level up your clean and your cabinets look amazing.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Education", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "DcJ-x8MP_U1", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcJ-x8MP_U1/", "caption": "The best way to clean up slime from carpet!", "timestamp": "2026-08-17T21:16:34.000Z", "videoDuration": 33.504944, "videoPlayCount": 136254, "likesCount": 2194, "commentsCount": 29, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fsyd12-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/775814321_18450368194140899_9164913619728870989_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NTk3NzA1NzY0NDUwODQ2OTE4NDUwMzY4MTkxMTQwODk5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEzMjAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=p13VRq2Z8d4Q7kNvwGBVQAj&_nc_oc=AdoDGFhm-BsZCEOdivAwBr8wFLa0U2TgWPgQb3RaJ5p81dJNWwipgOg74JMt74qyyzo&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsyd12-1.fna&_nc_gid=DWShw3faeIVapzJ-xivUGg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKecDgs5JlPNYA79NrpDpySJbLMaTO82Rb0sgaZYW_cPg&oe=6A9A1E5A", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fsyd12-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQONF9Aby8roib24-uhopkJMAP7qWvvEohh9oOp_GJ8dJMPiffRXrhMRqCim_Fg8B63k-_tnA6JG-AHTlbTM2eBvobmDl55ETYn33SY.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdrNBJFiVx3iN450DuGdAGDQwshRnKQNAxrJehJgrng3Nv7TrB0L1QtOrZo-ELk8HDs&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fsyd12-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=wv_gCYGQVE8Q7kNvwFvkaPd&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM1NjE0NTk2OTk2NDAyNCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjEyLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MzMsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=a6c48904f4c5c6e2&_nc_-3sitroBBUCKAJDMywXQEDAAAAAAAAYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=DWShw3faeIVapzJ-xivUGg&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQKNB51JzP2jHWxNDGG5lPPKK3Zge_EvfBA6uT2mXVGfqA&oe=6A9610CE", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "cleanthatup", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "28476690501956174"}, "ownerUsername": "cleanthatup", "ownerFullName": "Brandon Pleshek", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 127214, "likes": 2097, "comments": 27}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 136254, "likes": 2194, "comments": 29}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Let me show you how to actually clean up old dried slime from your carpet. Now all you need is something you might have already in your home and that is white distilled vinegar. Now you can just apply it to the slime or even soak a towel with the vinegar and let it set for a little while so that way it breaks everything down. Then I just grab a handy dandy spoon and start scooping from the outside in and the slime will slowly start to lift up. The reason this works so well is the vinegar is acidic so that breaks down the glue that's in the slime and that will lift it from the carpet fibers. Once everything's nice and cleaned up I do like to give it a quick rinse and dry and as you can see it cleaned up great so follow me for more helpful cleaning tips.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Education", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "Db9HC-5Pd00", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Db9HC-5Pd00/", "caption": "Have you ever tried the 2 minute rule?", "timestamp": "2026-08-12T21:19:25.000Z", "videoDuration": 12.766666, "videoPlayCount": 280361, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 2360, "commentsCount": 14, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fpoz5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/773713735_18449284978140899_5354951176289754248_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ig_cache_key=Mzk2MjM1NDIzODQ1Mjc4NDQzNjE4NDQ5Mjg0OTc1MTQwODk5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEzMjAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=oWF-G0sI7JwQ7kNvwHcaQPJ&_nc_oc=Adqg4HKyvXdrMSoFRTy8iI0DLaeDVn9KV7GBzfc61XAT2nVvJKh0clfXZtJWbPviKYc&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fpoz5-1.fna&_nc_gid=DETGt85y-9t5xY0GlO3GuA&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLEtBk7N9oEfe4Q7vOOEwgjc3R5NH-EGF7IEuVjCp9_eg&oe=6A9A3127", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fpoz5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMSK_fFqUrJ4MKAEWLRVhsfHTfwS5Dh3_0u6r